    <h2 class="section-title">Who We Are</h2>

    <article class="about-text">
      <p>
        CampusSwap is a student-built platform that makes it easy and affordable
        to rent equipment for school projects, events, and everyday campus life.
        Instead of buying gear you'll only use once, borrow it from fellow
        verified students and save money.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our goal is simple: connect students who have equipment sitting unused
        with students who need it, creating a safer, more sustainable, and more
        budget-friendly campus community.
      </p>
    </article>

