      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>💸 Affordability</h3>
        <p>Short-term rentals mean you only pay for what you need, when you need it.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>🌱 Sustainability</h3>
        <p>Sharing resources reduces waste and gets more use out of existing items.</p>
